{"seq":1,"slug":"return-reason-taxonomy-fit-classification","title":"退货原因分类体系与合身类退货识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/return-reduction-fit-assurance-program/return-driver-fit-diagnosis/return-reason-taxonomy-fit-classification","wordCount":3150,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"退货原因分类体系与合身类退货识别\">退货原因分类体系与合身类退货识别</h1><p>退货单上印着 <code>too_small</code> 的那一行，可能是真的一次尺码失误，也可能只是用户在退货页挑了最省事的选项——真想退回的理由是「颜色不喜欢」。合身类退货识别要解决的，就是在原因码本身不可靠的前提下，用可核验的证据把「因身体尺寸、成衣尺寸或版型预期不匹配而退回」的那部分订单重新圈出来。这不是分类动作，而是一次在<strong>不完整观测</strong>下的集合重建。NRF 与 Happy Returns 的《2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry》给出量级：2024 年美国零售退货总额约 6850 亿美元，占零售总额 16.9%，线上退货率约 17.6%，服饰线上退货率长期落在 20%–30%（Narvar 与 Coresight Research 的同类报告给出 20%–40% 区间），「尺码/合身」是首位诱因。识别不准，后续削减动作全部打空。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合身类退货是一个需要证据重建的集合\">核心概念：合身类退货是一个需要证据重建的集合</h2><p>先给一个可操作的判定：<strong>合身类退货</strong>（fit-related return）指退货的边际决定因素可归因于「身体尺寸 × 成衣尺寸 × 版型预期」三者中至少一处不匹配。判据是「如果这一处不匹配不存在，这笔退货大概率不会发生」，而不是「用户提到了尺码」。这个区分很关键——用户在同一次退货里可能既嫌大又嫌贵，只有前者属于合身治理的靶点。</p>\n<p>原因码之所以不能直接等于合身集合，是因为它承受三种偏差：<strong>自选择偏差</strong>（退货页选项少，用户选最接近的）、<strong>表达习惯偏差</strong>（不同市场用户对「偏小」的理解粒度不同）、<strong>填写激励偏差</strong>（有理由与无理由退货的流程差异会诱导用户填某个码）。因此原因码只能在<strong>观测层</strong>提供线索，真正的识别要跨层取证——这与<a href=\"size-fit-return-driver-analysis\">尺码合身的退货驱动分析</a>的取证链一致：观测层给先验，证据层给判定，本文只负责把判定结论做成可复算的合身退货集合。</p>\n<p>识别范式一共三种，选择取决于数据成熟度，也可叠加使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>识别范式</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>主要偏差</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>自报原因码命中合身分支</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>自选择与表达偏差，精度低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为式</td>\n<td>同款换码、退后重购不同码</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>漏掉直接退款不换码的用户</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推断式</td>\n<td>客服文本、尺码表交互、评论建模</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>模型误差，需抽检校准</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种范式的偏差方向不同，这正是它们能被组合起来互相校准的原因（见后文覆盖缺口一节）。工程上最常见的错误是只用声明式——覆盖率很高，看起来很美，但精度不可知，治理动作会持续打偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别信号的证据强度分层\">识别信号的证据强度分层</h2><p>把可用信号按「能否单独支撑判定」排序，是识别管线的第一条设计约束；判据是<strong>可核验性</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>证据强度</th>\n<th>可单信号定案</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同款换码（同 SKU 换相邻码）</td>\n<td>证据层</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>换码方向直接给出偏大/偏小符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退后重购同款不同码</td>\n<td>证据层</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>跨订单关联，需 30–60 天归因窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货质检实测 vs 标注</td>\n<td>证据层</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>指向规格缺陷，非用户选择问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自报合身类原因码</td>\n<td>观测层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>不建议</td>\n<td>需第二个信号佐证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客服/退货备注自由文本</td>\n<td>观测层</td>\n<td>中弱</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n<td>语义长尾，宜用模型加人工抽检</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺码表/助手打开与停留</td>\n<td>观测层</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n<td>只说明用户不确定，不说明结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评论中的尺码关键词</td>\n<td>观测层</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n<td>与退货单无一一对应，只做先验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>管线的形状因此是先强后弱、逐级降级：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;退货事件&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;原因码命中&lt;br/&gt;合身分支&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;候选合身退货&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{&quot;存在同款换码&lt;br/&gt;或退后重购&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| C&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[&quot;文本/交互模型打分&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;打分超阈值&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| C&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[&quot;判定为非合身&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; H[&quot;合身子类别判定&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;写入合身退货集合&lt;br/&gt;附证据字段与置信度&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"退货事件\"] --&gt; B{\"原因码命中&lt;br/&gt;合身分支\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"候选合身退货\"]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{\"存在同款换码&lt;br/&gt;或退后重购\"}\n  D --&gt;|是| C\n  D --&gt;|否| E[\"文本/交互模型打分\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"打分超阈值\"}\n  F --&gt;|是| C\n  F --&gt;|否| G[\"判定为非合身\"]\n  C --&gt; H[\"合身子类别判定\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"写入合身退货集合&lt;br/&gt;附证据字段与置信度\"]\n  G --&gt; I</pre><p>每一笔进入集合的退货都必须携带<strong>证据字段</strong>（哪一种信号、信号值、时间戳）与<strong>置信度</strong>。没有证据字段的条目，在做削减项目效果评估时无法剔除误判，会让 DiD 类因果评估系统性失真。</p>\n<p>识别质量用标准分类指标度量，召回率最要紧——漏掉的合身退货会进入分母，让削减效果被高估：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision} = \\frac{TP}{TP+FP},\\quad \\text{Recall} = \\frac{TP}{TP+FN},\\quad F_1 = \\frac{2PR}{P+R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>门槛建议精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span>、召回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span>；精度优先于召回，因为污染靶点比漏检更贵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合身子类别的判据与证据要求\">合身子类别的判据与证据要求</h2><p>把合身集合进一步细分，才能对应到不同的责任方与动作。子类别不是原因码的同义词——原因码是输入，子类别是判定结果，两者允许不一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子类别</th>\n<th>典型原因码输入</th>\n<th>必需证据</th>\n<th>主要混淆风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏小 too_small</td>\n<td>偏小、太紧、扣不上</td>\n<td>换码方向为升码，或体型档案与所选码差 &gt; 1 档</td>\n<td>把「紧身版型偏好未被满足」误判为码偏小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏大 too_big</td>\n<td>偏大、太松、像罩子</td>\n<td>换码方向为降码，或存在二次退货</td>\n<td>把「偏好宽松被判偏大」误读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版型与图片不符</td>\n<td>与描述不符、和图片不一样</td>\n<td>图文一致率抽检、版型图字段完整度</td>\n<td>与颜色差异混淆，需单独拆出颜色分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度不符</td>\n<td>太长、太短、拖地</td>\n<td>关键长度量体点（裤长/袖长/衣长）实测值</td>\n<td>与身高相关的选码问题混叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨色号尺码不一致</td>\n<td>同款不同色不一致</td>\n<td>同 SPU 不同 SKU 的成衣实测对比</td>\n<td>供应链规格漂移，易被记成用户问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面料手感与预期不符</td>\n<td>与描述不符</td>\n<td>成分标注核对、退货质检备注</td>\n<td>归「商品描述」还是「合身」需在词表里明确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是一个边界裁决点：面料手感通常归入「与描述不符」而非合身，但如果企业把缩水后不合身也算进来，就会污染合身退货率。<strong>边界必须在词表版本里写死并附判例</strong>，否则每个分析师的切法都不同，跨期对比立刻失效。跨色号尺码不一致这一项也值得单列——它直接指向<a href=\"../fit-assurance-program/fit-recommender-size-chart-architecture\">尺码表与合身推荐引擎架构</a>里强调的「成衣尺寸随批次变动」问题，是规格一致性缺陷而非模型缺陷，误判会持续给推荐模型背上不属于它的责任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖缺口-怎么知道漏掉了多少合身退货\">覆盖缺口：怎么知道漏掉了多少合身退货</h2><p>只用声明式识别时，没人知道漏了多少。补上这个盲区需要主动估计「真实合身退货总量」，而非被动接受已识别的数量。若有两个相对独立的识别通道（例如原因码通道与换码通道），可用<strong>捕获-再捕获</strong>估计真实规模，Chapman 估计量是常用的有偏校正形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N} = \\frac{(n_1+1)(n_2+1)}{m_2+1} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个通道各自识别的数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两通道同时识别的数量。它成立依赖<strong>通道近似独立</strong>：如果原因码选项本身就是按换码记录优化过的，两通道高度相关，重叠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 偏大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被系统性低估，仿真出「几乎没有漏检」的假象。缓解办法是引入第三个与运营解耦的通道。</p>\n<p>更稳妥的基准是<strong>人工抽检</strong>：每季度分层随机抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 单（按品类与市场分层），由有服装背景的标注员逐单判定，作为金标准反算管线召回率。分层抽样下合身占比的估计为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>h</mi></munder><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = \\sum_{h} W_h \\,\\hat{p}_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 层的订单占比。抽样量不够时用 Wilson 区间而非正态近似，避免小样本下区间越界。这套抽检是识别体系的<strong>唯一有效校准器</strong>——不做抽检的管线无法声称自己有召回率，这与<a href=\"return-rate-baseline-segmentation\">退货率基线与分段</a>里的口径固定问题同源：分母定义一变，历史对比就断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境场景的本地化与政策口径\">跨境场景的本地化与政策口径</h2><p>跨境电商让识别问题多出两层复杂性。第一层是<strong>法定撤回权与合身退货的口径冲突</strong>：欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 9 条规定的 14 天无理由撤回权，用户无需说明理由即可退货；美国联邦贸易委员会《邮购与电话订购商品规则》（16 CFR Part 435）的取消权语义与之不同。在这类订单上，合身退货被用户标为「无理由」是合法且常见的，识别管线必须允许从无理由类别里<strong>反推</strong>合身退货（依赖换码、重购、文本等证据），而不能简单地把它排除。词表应附带 <code>market</code> 与 <code>policy_basis</code> 字段，把「合规撤回」与「合身问题」分开记账，否则合规退货会被算成质量事故，退货率基线被人为抬高。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>原因码的本地化漂移</strong>：多语言退货页的选项经翻译后语义层级往往不对齐，同一个 <code>too_small</code> 在德语、日语、西班牙语页面上的颗粒度可能不同。跨市场对比前必须通过一张显式的编码映射表把各市场原因码投影到统一词表，并给映射表打版本号——映射规则一改，之前的市场对比全部作废。与之配套的是尺码标识本身的跨市场映射：欧洲采用 EN 13402 的尺码标识体系，美国、英国、日本各有自有体系，映射错误本身就是一台合身退货生成器，识别时必须区分「用户选码失误」与「跨市场尺码换算失误」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见识别反模式\">常见识别反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自报即事实</td>\n<td>直接把 <code>too_small</code> 记为码偏小</td>\n<td>靶点污染，动作打偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单通道识别</td>\n<td>只用原因码，不做换码与文本交叉</td>\n<td>召回率不可知，效果被高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不设边界判例</td>\n<td>面料/颜色/缩水是否算合身无定论</td>\n<td>跨期口径漂移，对比失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无证据字段</td>\n<td>集合条目不可追溯</td>\n<td>因果评估无法剔除误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词表就地改语义</td>\n<td>不版本化，直接改旧码含义</td>\n<td>历史归因不可复算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分母混用</td>\n<td>用全部订单作合身退货率分母</td>\n<td>比率失真，应固定为已签收订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从不抽检</td>\n<td>无金标准，无召回率</td>\n<td>识别体系无法自我校准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前四条靠强制证据字段、边界判例与版本化词表拦住；后三条是制度问题，需季度抽检与口径冻结配套，单靠工具无法解决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合身类退货不是原因码，而是一个在自选择、表达、激励三重偏差下需要<strong>证据重建</strong>的集合；判据是「缺了这处不匹配就不会退」。</li>\n<li>识别有三种范式——声明式、行为式、推断式——覆盖率与偏差方向各不相同，组合使用才能互相校准；单用声明式会让精度不可知。</li>\n<li>信号按可核验性分层：同款换码与退后重购可单独定案，自报原因码需第二信号佐证，尺码表停留与评论关键词只能当先验。</li>\n<li>合身子类别（偏小/偏大/版型不符/长度不符/跨色号不一致/面料）各有必需证据与混淆风险；面料归属与跨色号不一致必须在词表版本里写死判例。</li>\n<li>覆盖缺口用捕获-再捕获（Chapman 估计量）估规模，但其成立依赖通道近似独立；人工分层抽检是唯一有效校准器，用于反算召回率。</li>\n<li>跨境场景要额外处理法定撤回权（欧盟 2011/83/EU）与多市场尺码标识（EN 13402 vs 各国体系）带来的口径与映射问题，词表需带 <code>market</code> 与 <code>policy_basis</code>。</li>\n<li>识别质量以精度优先（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span>）、召回量化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span>）为门槛；无证据字段、无版本词表、无抽检的识别体系不应被信任。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退货原因分类体系与合身类退货识别","id":"退货原因分类体系与合身类退货识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合身类退货是一个需要证据重建的集合","id":"核心概念-合身类退货是一个需要证据重建的集合"},{"level":2,"text":"识别信号的证据强度分层","id":"识别信号的证据强度分层"},{"level":2,"text":"合身子类别的判据与证据要求","id":"合身子类别的判据与证据要求"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖缺口：怎么知道漏掉了多少合身退货","id":"覆盖缺口-怎么知道漏掉了多少合身退货"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景的本地化与政策口径","id":"跨境场景的本地化与政策口径"},{"level":2,"text":"常见识别反模式","id":"常见识别反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"尺寸合身退货驱动分析：身材分布、版型与尺码偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/return-reduction-fit-assurance-program/return-driver-fit-diagnosis/size-fit-return-driver-analysis"}}